==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A variant of [[vegetarian]], whose diet excludes animal flesh, but accepts food that can be produced from a living animal without causing death or undue suffering (such as eggs, honey, and dairy products).

====Synonyms====
*''ovo-lacto-vegetarian''
*''ovolactovegetarian''

